<title>FRANCE: Accor denies it selling Motel 6 chain.</title>
<headline>Accor denies it selling Motel 6 chain.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French hotel group Accor denied on Monday an agency report which said it wanted to sell its U.S. Motel 6 chain or dispose of the property assets and retain the management contracts.</p>
<p>Traders said the stock, which was up 1.64 percent to 869 francs, was supported by the news report. The market was up 0.08 percent.</p>
</text>
